#: kcontrol/componentchooser/componentservices/kcm_browser.desktop:76
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"Here you can configure your default web browser. All KDE applications in "
"which you can select hyperlinks should honor this setting."
msgstr ""
"Esti serviciu permite configurar el restolador web predetermináu. Toles "
"aplicaciones KDE que permitan escoyer hiperenllaces tendríen de reconocer "
